Package: libdata-powerset-perl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${perl:Depends}
Description: generate all subsets of a list of elements
 Data::PowerSet takes a list and returns all possible combinations of the
 elements appearing in the list without replacement.
 PacketFence uses it through fingerbank.
